A while back I wrote:
>I'm having trouble with running nethack on a PC.  I get the game to execute
>OK, but instead of printing the screen it just prints lots of garbage (with
>some normal text intertwined).  I think the problem is with the termcap.
>Just how do I get this game to print properly on the screen?

Rather than sending out a gazillion thank-yous to half the email addresses
on the net, I thought I'd just send one out to all of them.  :-)
Thank you all (and I think I really do mean _all_) for responding.  And the
answer was:  put the line device=<path>\ansi.sys in my config.sys file.

BTW, to those who said (in various words) "RTFM":  real hackers don't read
manuals.  B^)
